<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - DM Grenfell ups 3 mining stocks.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - DM Grenfell ups 3 mining stocks.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said it raised the rating on Phelps Dodge Corp to buy from accumulate, saying the stock price is undervalued as the price of copper increases.</p>
<p>-- upgraded Cyprus Amax Minerals Co to accumulate from hold, and ASARCO Inc to buy from hold, also on price.</p>
<p>-- Phelps Dodge gained 5/8 to 72-1/4, ASARCO fell 5/8 to 30-1/4, and Cyprus added 3/8 to 23-1/4.</p>
</text>
